  message: "Done in PR #2291 (dev 703dce32b; commit ee52e4e44 one factory analyze/base.py mint_stand_in_fingerprint; label decision followed in 7ccd08a4b, WI-kabuh). Live on dev 703dce32b: grep -rnE 'hexdigest\\(\\)\\[:16\\]' packages/*/src -> 6 hits, none a fingerprint or a digest of a node id (5 are edge:sha256:<content> edge ids in cmake/toml_config/json_config/dockerfile/make, 1 the tracker's cache key); mint_stand_in_fingerprint is defined once (base.py:2290) and called from annotation_convention, crypto_flow, message_dispatch, tauri_ipc, yjs_crdt and the backstop. hypergumbo survey on agent 5's stand-in fixture (copy of pr3/agent5/fixtures/tovog_fx2) -> rc=0; 11 language=None nodes, all 11 fingerprints 'hgstandinfp1:<16hex>' from the factory (e.g. javascript:web/recv.js:3-3:PING:function -> hgstandinfp1:3232ff27ef9d781c); source nodes hgfp2: (22); 0 fingerprint validation violations. test_stand_in_fingerprint.py (scans packages/*/src for an inline fingerprint digest) passed under scripts/smart-test (138 passed). Evidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/closure_pr3/tovog.txt, ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/closure_pr3/smarttest_core.txt"  # 5504
